rt List, Dict\n\ndef dif_Square(n: int) -> bool:\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise ValueError("Input must be an integer.")\n    if n == 0:\n        return True\n    if n % 4 == 2:\n        return False\n    return True\n</answer>'
